        "PMC12019924::web::003::main",
        "PMC12019924::web::009::tribological_performance_of_2d_hea"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Applying the coating will reduce wear rate relative to untreated HEA surfaces.",
